    <p class="adx-p">It isn't laziness and it isn't age. It's what happens when the <strong>mechanics of how you breathe and wake at night</strong> quietly change — and nobody tells you.</p>

    <div class="adx-rule"></div>

    <h2 class="adx-h2">Why everything you've tried made sense — and still didn't work</h2>
