      <div class="adx-vscol"><div class="adx-vsh">Louder / multiple alarms</div><ul class="adx-xlist adx-xlist--bad"><li>Cortisol jolt — stressful wake-ups</li><li>Wakes your partner too</li><li>Still gets snoozed</li></ul></div>
